      "statement": "--add-user generates an extra provisioner key pair sent as AddUserPublicKey and writes the returned AddUserCertificate as <base>-provisioner{,.pub,-cert.pub}; user certificates are added to the ssh-agent after signing unless --no-agent is set, with agent failures printed in red without failing the command.",
