      "statement": "loginOnUnauthorized builds a ca.RetryFunc for HTTP 401 that checks RequireClientAuthentication, generates an OIDC identity token requiring an email, signs a user certificate for the email with an identity CSR, writes the default identity, and adds the certificate to the agent with ignored errors, enabling transparent SSO re-authentication.",
      "evidence": [
