    {
      "id": "claim_2bee8c96e1204701806a945280cda1b4",
      "statement": "step ssh config supports --team (running BootstrapTeamAuthority with default authority ssh), --roots/--federation which print CA user/host public keys as TYPE BASE64 lines (404 reported as SSH not configured), and a default template flow that builds data (GOOS, StepPath, StepBasePath, version v2, Context, --set), infers User from the first CA-signed agent certificate, and writes or dry-prints the fetched SSHConfig templates.",
