      "statement": "step ssh hosts lists the host registry as a HOSTNAME/ID/TAGS table via client.SSHGetHosts with the 401 retry func, and step ssh check-host queries SSHCheckHost (building an x5c token from the stored identity with issuer x5c-identity and audience /ssh/check-host when mTLS is required) and exits 1 when the host does not exist.",
