    {
      "id": "claim_41cb3ffdf77a4cca94a339b47ed93a72",
      "statement": "step ssh proxycommand first calls doLoginIfNeeded, which dials the ssh-agent and returns if a CA-user-root-signed certificate is present, otherwise performs a full user-certificate login (backdated validAfter, OIDC email subject, identity CSR when required) added to the agent; it then looks up the bastion via client.SSHBastion and connects through the bastion or directly.",
