    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8495168bf4534ad6982ab2b31bf535d4",
      "statement": "proxyBastion locates ssh via exec.LookPath (fallback /usr/bin/ssh), builds -l/-p/bastion-flags (split with strings.Fields) plus a rendered bastion Command (%%, %h, %p, %r substitution) or nc host port, and calls exec.Exec which on Unix uses syscall.Exec (execve) to replace the step process with the ssh client, while on Windows exec.Run inherits stdio, forwards all signals to the child via a signalHandler goroutine, and exits with the child's exit status.",
